# Build products, not sources. The fonts themselves are sources as far as this
# tree is concerned: they are what the repository is for, and the sibling
# project carries its own the same way. What stays out is anything a reader
# produces locally from them.
sbitgraft-*/sbitgraft
sbitgraft-*/*.o
sbitgraft-*/*.exe
*-nohint.ttc
*-nohint.ttf
__pycache__/
*.pyc
